        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Create and Process Support Request Activity Diagram\nskinparam defaultTextAlignment center\nskinparam wrapWidth 160\n|Work Area Leader|\nstart\n:Identify lack of volunteers or skills;\n:Create support request;\n|System|\n:Display support request form;\n|Work Area Leader|\n:Enter request description and deadline;\n:Add support positions;\n:Add required skills for each position;\n:Submit request;\n|System|\n:Validate request positions;\nif (Has at least one position?) then (Yes)\nelse (No)\n  :Show missing position error;\n  detach\nendif\n:Validate required volunteer count;\nif (Count is greater than zero?) then (Yes)\nelse (No)\n  :Show invalid count error;\n  detach\nendif\n:Save support request;\n:Set request status to Open;\n|Volunteer or Community|\n:View support request;\n:Submit support response;\n|System|\n:Validate response members;\nif (Member has required skills?) then (Yes)\nelse (No)\n  :Show skill mismatch error;\n  detach\nendif\n:Check position capacity;\nif (Position has available slot?) then (Yes)\nelse (No)\n  :Show full position error;\n  detach\nendif\n|Committee|\n:Review response member;\nif (Approve member?) then (Yes)\n  |System|\n  :Set member status to Approved;\nelse (No)\n  |System|\n  :Set member status to Rejected;\n  detach\nendif\nif (Request is fully filled?) then (Yes)\n  :Set request status to Fulfilled;\nelse (No)\n  :Keep request status Open;\nendif\nstop\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="1RuOQkMxXsnQus1tGjYM-300">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
