        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Manage Material Requirement Activity Diagram\nskinparam defaultTextAlignment center\nskinparam wrapWidth 160\n|Material Officer|\nstart\n:Open work area material page;\n:Select Manage Material Requirement;\n|System|\n:Display material list;\n|Material Officer|\n:Select material;\n:Enter required quantity and existing quantity;\n:Enter requirement note;\n:Click Save;\n|System|\n:Validate material status;\nif (Material is active?) then (Yes)\nelse (No)\n  :Show inactive material error;\n  detach\nendif\n:Validate quantities;\nif (Quantities are valid?) then (Yes)\nelse (No)\n  :Show quantity error;\n  detach\nendif\n:Check existing requirement;\nif (Requirement already exists?) then (Yes)\n  :Update material requirement;\nelse (No)\n  :Create material requirement;\nendif\n:Calculate material shortage;\nif (Has shortage?) then (Yes)\n  :Mark material as Shortage;\nelse (No)\n  :Mark material as Sufficient;\nendif\n:Display material summary;\nstop\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="1RuOQkMxXsnQus1tGjYM-382">
